# gpu_burn output, timed: <ms since start>|<printf %b text>; "end-<ms>" and "end" count
# from the run time the mock was given.
# The formats are the printf strings of gpu_burn-drv.cpp at commit 3ead140 (lines 144-147,
# 187-196, 552-592, 612, 660-664, 913-914); the "GPU 0: ... (UUID" line is what its
# system("nvidia-smi -L") prints. Numbers, the date line and the timing (a run squeezed
# into 2 s) are reconstruction, unverified against the real tool.
# The run takes its full time and the summary says OK, but no progress line was printed,
# so no error count was ever seen (contract #140 case 7a).
